<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<main class="container" id="main" style="padding:1.2rem 0 2.6rem">
  <nav class="breadcrumbs dark"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span class="cur">About Biahens</span></nav>

  <section class="page-head" style="border-radius:var(--radius);padding:clamp(1.6rem,4vw,3rem);margin-bottom:1.3rem">
    <span class="badge gold">Accra, Ghana · Owner curated</span>
    <h1 style="color:#fff;margin:.65rem 0 .5rem;font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500">A little more meaning in what you wear.</h1>
    <p class="sub" style="max-width:68ch"><%= settings.store_name %> is a fashion house for thoughtful everyday style, expressive African design and the details that make a look your own.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="grid g-2" style="gap:1rem;align-items:start">
    <div class="card pad prose">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Our point of view</span>
      <h2>One edit. One owner. A real person behind every piece.</h2>
      <p>We believe shopping should feel personal, not overwhelming. Biahens Enterprise focuses on fashion: clothing, shoes, bags and accessories selected for quality, character and the way they fit into real life in Ghana.</p>
      <p>Every product on this website is uploaded and managed by the owner. We do not operate an open marketplace or host third-party sellers. That means the person choosing the collection is also accountable for the description, the price and your order.</p>
      <h2>What matters to us</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Style with character.</b> Contemporary staples sit alongside Ankara, Kente and Ghanaian-inspired pieces.</li>
        <li><b>Honest product details.</b> Clear descriptions, available sizes and stock shown as accurately as possible.</li>
        <li><b>A considered collection.</b> We would rather offer a focused edit than fill the store with listings we cannot stand behind.</li>
        <li><b>Helpful, human service.</b> Reach out for sizing, delivery or order support before or after you shop.</li>
        <li><b>Fashion for Ghana.</b> Secure checkout and delivery options for customers across the country.</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn primary" href="/new-arrivals">Explore the latest edit <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>

    <aside class="stack" style="gap:1rem">
      <div class="card" style="overflow:hidden">
        <img src="/img/fashion/kente-style.jpg" alt="Kente styling from the Biahens fashion edit" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 30%">
        <div class="pad" style="padding:1.1rem">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">Rooted here. Ready everywhere.</span>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:500">A Ghanaian eye for style.</h3>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin:0">We make room for the prints, craft and ideas that tell our stories — styled in a way that feels current and completely your own.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card pad">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:500">Talk to a person</h3>
        <p class="small muted">Need help with a size, an order or delivery? We are happy to help.</p>
        <div class="stack small" style="gap:.55rem">
          <a class="row" href="tel:<%= settings.support_phone.replace(/\s/g,'') %>"><%- icon('phone') %> <%= settings.support_phone %></a>
          <a class="row" href="https://wa.me/<%= (settings.support_whatsapp || '').replace(/[^0-9]/g,'') %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><%- icon('whatsapp') %> WhatsApp Biahens</a>
          <a class="row" href="mailto:<%= settings.support_email %>"><%- icon('mail') %> <%= settings.support_email %></a>
        </div>
        <a class="btn ghost block" style="margin-top:1rem" href="/contact">Contact us</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
